--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 512a72de08c75cf4e8a8424f7b75a271, type: 3}
  m_Name: D6T4_AdvisorProgressReport_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npc: 0
  sequence:
  - dialogueText: Any progress on our situation? You look like a man with an update.
    buttonText: Found a way
  - dialogueText: Speak quietly. This room has ears. Who has the solution?
    buttonText: The loony knows
  - dialogueText: The loony... He's resourceful, obviously. But knowledge won't get
      us off this island. We need a boat.
    buttonText: We made a plan
  - dialogueText: A plan with the Lady? That covers the coordination. But the ship
      itself?
    buttonText: Indian can provide
  - dialogueText: The Indian... He doesn't give anything away for free. What's the
      catch?
    buttonText: One last job
  - dialogueText: Risky as hell. But given the state of affairs, it might be the
      only option we have left. Count me in.
    buttonText: You're in
  - dialogueText: I can handle a gun and I know how to drive a boat. I won't be a
      liability.
    buttonText: Perfect
  - dialogueText: Good. The Indian has it? I think he's gesturing toward you right
      now. It seems he's ready.
    buttonText: Time to talk
  - dialogueText: Exactly. Go secure that boat.
    buttonText: On it
